The '''Ice Castle''' (also known as '''Winter Castle''' on [[Portal]]'s '''[C] World Warp''' GUI) is an [[Locations|island]] in [[Second Sea]].

==Appearance==
The Ice Castle is vast, with a massive castle towering over the island. There are chunks of flat ice cubes lying around the island on the water and in front of the island.

==Location==
The Ice Castle is located north of [[Dark Arena]], in the [[Second Sea]]. 

