==Chests==
There are a total of 9 chests:
* 1 Diamond Chest
* 5 Golden Chests
* 3 Silver Chests

==Notes==
* Once using the [[Library Key]] on the door in the castle to access the NPC [[Phoeyu The Reformed]], it will save, which means that the player can come back whenever they want, even after leaving the game.
* The [[Hidden Key]] and [[Library Key]] obtained from any of the NPCs do '''NOT''' save on the players [[inventory]] if they leave the game.
* The [[Hidden Key]] can be used by going underneath the side of the stairs [[Awakened Ice Admiral]] spawns on, then after going through the wall, the player can find a black colored [[Chests|chest]] with a keyhole, use the Key on it, and they will be rewarded with the {{Legendary}} sword, [[Rengoku]].
* The Ice Castle is commonly visited by high-level players to get a [[Hidden Key]] for [[Rengoku]], so the player should be careful when grinding here.

==Trivia==
* Until [[Updates/24|Update 24]], the player could fly through [[Hoops]] to change their appearance if they were using the [[Dragon]] fruit.

